    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“What was lost remembers you.”</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, when a <strong>construct, vehicle, drone, or mech</strong> within <strong>12 squares</strong> of you is reduced to 0 Integrity, you can use your <strong>reaction</strong> to drag its pattern back through the wires.</p><ul><li>The target is immediately restored to <strong>half its Integrity maximum</strong>.</li><li>It can immediately take a <strong>full turn</strong> (move, action, and bonus action) as part of this reaction, acting on the current initiative.</li><li>It gains <strong>temporary Integrity equal to your Soul-Smith level</strong> and a bonus of <strong>+tier to all damage rolls</strong> it deals for 1 minute.</li><li>Allies within 2 squares of it deal <strong>+1 damage</strong> on their weapon attacks and have <strong>advantage</strong> on defense check against being <strong>stunned</strong> or <strong>paralyzed</strong> for the same duration.</li></ul><p><strong>OP Echo.</strong> If the resurrected construct contributes to completing a strategic or tactical goal before this aura ends, your faction gains <strong>+1 Economy OP</strong> and <strong>+1 Intrigue OP</strong> for the next strategic turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
